      "translation": "One day, on my way to school, I saw an orange cat stuck in a tree. He was wearing a wizard hat! The cat looked scared, so I wanted to help.",
      "translations": [
        "One day, on my way to school, I saw an orange cat stuck in a tree. He was wearing a wizard hat! The cat looked scared, so I wanted to help.",
        "I climbed up the tree and saved him. He gave me a magic apple. I took a bite, and it gave me a superpower! I could talk to animals!",
        "“Can I come home with you?” the cat asked.",
        "“Yes!” I said. I took him home, and now we play together every day."
      ],
